Query values are strings in req.query, and a missing one is NIL
(Requirement 7.2, 3.8). req.path is the path without the query.

### two values
GET /search?q=ghost&limit=3
=> 200

{"q": "ghost", "limit": "3", "missing": null, "path": "/search"}

### an escaped value
GET /search?q=haunted%20house
=> 200

{"q": "haunted house", "limit": null, "missing": null, "path": "/search"}

### no query
GET /search
=> 200

{"q": null, "limit": null, "missing": null, "path": "/search"}
